# Line endings are normalized to LF in the index AND in the working tree.
#
# Nine files once arrived in a working tree converted wholesale to CRLF: a
# 2873-line diff with zero content change. That noise hides real edits during
# review, which matters more here than usual, because this repo is reviewed line
# by line by a second model. eol=lf rather than native because every consumer of
# these files - Python, git, pytest, GitHub Actions on ubuntu-latest - reads LF,
# and a CRLF .ps1 is harmless while a CRLF-vs-LF diff is not.
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png           binary
*.ico           binary
